**How to apply:** Before writing any agent/skill/command, check what the library says about the concept. Query the datastore (`require('./datastore.js').load()`) for related entities. When you need a field an entity doesn't have, compute the best substitute from attribute co-occurrence in the corpus, not from type-specific hardcoded logic.","replace_all":false}

